---
title: "Drawbridge — The fourth-party chain: your vendor's vendors, diffed against your own register"
---
flowchart LR
  ORG["<b>Your organisation</b><br/>reviewed and signed exactly one contract"]
  V["<b>DataDynamo Logistics</b> · Tier 1<br/>reviewed · Trust Score 64 · conditional"]

  EXTRACT["<b>Structured extraction</b> · Gemini 3.5 Flash<br/>name · purpose · processes customer data<br/>jurisdiction · agreement claimed<br/>five fields, and the model reads nothing else"]
  REG[("<b>approved_vendors</b><br/>this organisation's own register<br/>readers and no writer, in all 10 identities —<br/>an agent that could write to it could make<br/>an unknown fourth party known")]
  DIFF["<b>Set difference and date comparison</b><br/>no model call below this line —<br/>every finding is source=rule"]

  S1["<b>Sendline Notifications</b><br/>recipient names, phones, addresses · EU (Dublin)<br/><b>not on the register · never reviewed here</b>"]
  S2["<b>Wayfarer Geocoding</b><br/>origin and destination addresses · EU (Paris)<br/>on the register · <b>review lapsed 2025-09-30</b>"]
  S3["<b>Aurelius Cloud Services</b><br/>hosting and storage · EU (Frankfurt)<br/>on the register · rv-2024-0117 current"]
  S4["<b>Ledgerbridge Analytics</b><br/>internal usage counters, no customer data<br/>on the register · rv-2025-0088 current"]

  F1["<b>unknown_fourth_party</b> · medium<br/>one per company"]
  F2["<b>register_review_expired</b> · low<br/>date computed, not declared"]
  F3["<b>no_dpa_claimed</b> · low<br/>one per vendor · stated absence only"]
  F4["<b>jurisdiction_outside_residency</b> · medium<br/>one per vendor · only if intake states one"]

  BEAT["<b>Beat · fourth_party_gap</b><br/>named on the timeline before the gate,<br/>not in row four of a table after it"]
  GATE{"<b>Every finding gates on<br/>processes_customer_data</b><br/>a telemetry provider receiving counters<br/>raises nothing — sixteen findings about<br/>one vendor is how a feature becomes<br/>the tab nobody opens"}

  ORG -- "one contract" --> V
  V --> EXTRACT
  EXTRACT --> DIFF
  REG --> DIFF
  DIFF --> S1
  DIFF --> S2
  DIFF --> S3
  DIFF --> S4

  S1 ==> F1
  S2 --> F2
  S4 -. "silent · raises nothing" .-> GATE
  GATE --- F3
  GATE --- F4
  F1 ==> BEAT

  classDef org fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-width:2px,color:#1e3a8a
  classDef known fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,stroke-width:2px,color:#14532d
  classDef lapsed fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,stroke-width:2px,color:#78350f
  classDef unknown fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#7f1d1d
  classDef proc fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#6d28d9,stroke-width:2px,color:#4c1d95
  classDef gate fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,stroke-width:2px,color:#7c2d12
  class ORG,V org
  class S3,S4,REG known
  class S2,F2,F3,F4 lapsed
  class S1,F1,BEAT unknown
  class EXTRACT,DIFF proc
  class GATE gate

  linkStyle 8 stroke:#b91c1c,stroke-width:3px,color:#b91c1c
  linkStyle 13 stroke:#b91c1c,stroke-width:3px,color:#b91c1c
